{"seq":2,"slug":"promise-exception-replanning","title":"承诺异常与重承诺：缺货、延迟与改址触发的重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-exception-replanning","wordCount":2989,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"承诺异常与重承诺-缺货-延迟与改址触发的重排\">承诺异常与重承诺：缺货、延迟与改址触发的重排</h1><p>一笔承诺在生成的那一刻就已经是<strong>过期数据</strong>。下单时引擎读到告罄仓有 12 件现货，两分钟后广州仓的盘亏把它变成 4 件；承诺的 3-5 日达里，第 2 天深圳口岸因台风关闭 36 小时；买家第 4 天把收货地址从深圳改到乌鲁木齐。这三件事都不改变订单本身，却各自击穿了一次已经对买家公开的承诺。重承诺（re-promising）要解决的正是这条链路：承诺已发出、买家已据此决策之后，如何检测失效、重新求解、并以最小代价交付一个新的可信日期。承诺交期自身的算法见 <a href=\"../atp-ctp-promise-model/promise-date-computation-model\">承诺日期计算模型</a>，被重排所竞争的库存口径见 <a href=\"../inventory-supply-availability/net-available-quantity-computation\">净可承诺量计算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺是带失效条件的合约\">核心概念：承诺是带失效条件的合约</h2><p>把承诺看作一张合约，就有两个必须同时成立的字段：<strong>日期</strong>和<strong>置信区间</strong>。只承诺日期不承诺置信度，等于对买家撒谎——而谎言的代价可以直接量化。亚马逊对卖家自配送（FBM）设有取消率（&lt; 2.5%）、迟发率（&lt; 4%）两条硬指标，并逐步推行按承诺送达日考核的准时送达率 OTDR 与送达日期准确率，跌破门槛直接触发账户健康处罚（亚马逊卖家中心 Account Health / FBM 绩效指标）；淘宝延迟发货规则要求卖家在承诺时效内发货，未履行按实际成交金额一定比例赔付（淘宝规则中心《延迟发货的规则与实施细则》）。因此重承诺不是&quot;改善体验&quot;的加分项，而是<strong>阻止一次承诺失效演变成一次平台处罚</strong>的补救动作。</p>\n<p>从工程角度看，一次承诺需要记录四种状态，缺一不可：| 状态字段 | 含义 | 失效时谁受影响 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 承诺日期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> | 对买家公开的收货截止 | 买家决策、平台考核 |\n| 置信度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> | 该日期成立的概率（如 P90 分位） | 是否需要提前预警 |\n| 支撑资源集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span></span></span></span></span> | 该承诺依赖的库存节点 + 产能资源 + 路由 | 任一资源失效即触发 |\n| 承诺版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> | 单调递增，每次重排 +1 | 幂等、审计、买家通知 |</p>\n<p>关键设计判断是：<strong>记录支撑资源集</strong>。多数早期引擎只存一个 <code>promised_date</code>，当库存被别的订单吃掉时，系统无法回答&quot;这张单为什么应该重排&quot;，只能全量重算。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 存下来，重排就从&quot;全量重算&quot;缩小为&quot;局部修复&quot;——这是重承诺能秒级完成的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[承诺已发出: d, q, R, v] --&gt; B{监控信号}&#10;    B --&gt;|库存跌破| C[缺货类例外]&#10;    B --&gt;|时长链漂移| D[延迟类例外]&#10;    B --&gt;|地址变更| E[改址类例外]&#10;    B --&gt;|支付/风控| F[冻结类例外]&#10;    C --&gt; G[标记受影响承诺集]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[按优先级重求解]&#10;    H --&gt; I{新解是否优于旧承诺?}&#10;    I --&gt;|优于或持平| J[静默更新版本 v+1]&#10;    I --&gt;|劣化超阈值| K[触发买家通知 + 补偿决策]&#10;    I --&gt;|无可行解| L[人工例外队列]\">graph TD\n    A[承诺已发出: d, q, R, v] --&gt; B{监控信号}\n    B --&gt;|库存跌破| C[缺货类例外]\n    B --&gt;|时长链漂移| D[延迟类例外]\n    B --&gt;|地址变更| E[改址类例外]\n    B --&gt;|支付/风控| F[冻结类例外]\n    C --&gt; G[标记受影响承诺集]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[按优先级重求解]\n    H --&gt; I{新解是否优于旧承诺?}\n    I --&gt;|优于或持平| J[静默更新版本 v+1]\n    I --&gt;|劣化超阈值| K[触发买家通知 + 补偿决策]\n    I --&gt;|无可行解| L[人工例外队列]</pre><h2 id=\"例外分类与触发信号\">例外分类与触发信号</h2><p>例外不是一种，而是四类，它们的触发源、传播速度和处理策略都不同。把四类混在一个队列里处理，是重承诺系统最常见的结构性错误——缺货需要秒级、延迟可以分钟级、改址必须走确认流。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>例外类别</th>\n<th>典型触发信号</th>\n<th>传播范围</th>\n<th>处置时窗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缺货（stockout）</td>\n<td>WMS 盘点差异、超卖扣减失败、供应商 ASN 取消</td>\n<td>单节点，可能波及全部占用该节点的承诺</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟（delay）</td>\n<td>口岸拥堵、承运商取件未扫、干线爆仓、罢工</td>\n<td>路由级，一次波及成千承诺</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改址（address change）</td>\n<td>买家自助改址、地址纠错、地址风控拦截</td>\n<td>单订单，但可能跨越承诺仓覆盖范围</td>\n<td>小时级（需确认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻结（hold）</td>\n<td>支付失败、风控审核、合规扣押</td>\n<td>单订单</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前两类是<strong>供给侧</strong>例外——承诺所依赖的资源变少了；后两类是<strong>需求侧</strong>例外——订单约束变了。二者在数学上互为对偶：前者求解&quot;在减少的资源下能否维持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;，后者求解&quot;在新地址约束下最早已达日是多少&quot;。</p>\n<p>触发信号的工程难点不在识别，而在<strong>去噪与降级</strong>。库存同步本身带滞后（见 <a href=\"../inventory-supply-availability/inventory-sync-consistency-lag\">库存同步一致性与滞后</a>），一个未确认的盘点差异若立即触发全量重排，会在每次夜盘时把系统打爆。成熟做法把信号分三层：<strong>瞬时抖动</strong>（差值小于安全库存、且在去抖窗口内恢复）不触发；<strong>持续偏离</strong>（连续 N 个采样周期同向偏离）触发局部重排；<strong>硬事件</strong>（节点下线、承运商停运公告）直接触发。硬事件适合走标准通道：GS1 EPCIS 2.0 的事件词汇（ObjectEvent / AggregationEvent / TransformationEvent / AssociationEvent，GS1 2022 年发布 2.0 版，见 gs1.org/standards/epcis）表达&quot;某可追溯对象在某地发生了某事件&quot;；库存水位类信号更适合内部 CDC 流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重承诺的排序与守恒\">重承诺的排序与守恒</h2><p>重排不能重排一次算一次，否则会出现<strong>重排雪崩</strong>：一次口岸拥堵让 5 万张承诺同时劣化，逐单重求解会耗尽算力，且不断产生中间态。正确做法是引入<strong>守恒约束</strong>：承诺占用的不是&quot;某个日期&quot;，而是某个资源配额。系统在受影响集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 上重新分配配额并满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>release</mtext></msubsup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>held</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall r,\\,t:\\quad \\sum_{k \\in U} c_{k,r,t} \\;\\le\\; C_{r,t}^{\\text{release}} \\;+\\; \\sum_{k \\notin U} c_{k,r,t}^{\\text{held}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">release</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"llap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0651em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">held</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{k,r,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 在资源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的时间桶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 上的占用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>release</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{r,t}^{\\text{release}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">release</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是本次可释放的容量，右侧第二项是未被本次重排触及的既有占用。含义是：<strong>重排只在受影响集合内部做零和再分配，绝不凭空创造或侵占集合外资源</strong>，新承诺的占用必须落在同一批资源的可用范围内。</p>\n<p>在此约束下，四种排序策略决定了谁被牺牲。<strong>承诺冻结期</strong>：距发货日不足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（跨境通常 24-48 小时）的承诺不参与重排，只允许延期通知、不允许换仓——此时货已上楼、面单已出。<strong>价值×优先级</strong>：会员等级、加急服务、金额构成权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，稀缺资源优先给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高者；重排时还需乘一个<strong>劣化幅度惩罚</strong>——已承诺 3 日达的单被劣化到 9 日达，伤害远大于新单直接报 9 日达。<strong>最小改动优先</strong>：优先选只需换仓、不需延期的方案，把日期变更的订单数压到最小，因为日期变更必然触发通知与客服咨询。<strong>成组重排</strong>：同一路由、波次、承诺日期的订单作为原子组一起重排，避免组内不一致导致客服话术无法统一。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Score</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}_k \\;=\\; w_k \\cdot \\bigl(1 + \\lambda \\max(0,\\, d_k^{\\text{new}} - d_k^{\\text{old}})\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是劣化惩罚系数，越大则系统越倾向&quot;宁可牺牲低价值单也不动高价值单的日期&quot;。跨境实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 通常设得较高，因为一次承诺劣化的客诉成本往往高于单件毛利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"改址与拆单的重承诺\">改址与拆单的重承诺</h2><p>改址是最容易被低估的分支。买家直觉是&quot;换个地址而已&quot;，但在承诺引擎里，地址是<strong>决定覆盖仓与路由的输入</strong>，不是输出上的一个标签。</p>\n<p>地址变更会触发三个连锁判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>覆盖范围是否仍成立</strong>：新地址不在原仓的时效覆盖圈内，原承诺的日期就是假的，必须重跑覆盖判定，得出新地址下最早的可用仓。</li>\n<li><strong>是否已进入不可逆阶段</strong>：货已出库、面单已生成时，改址变成&quot;拦截 + 退回 + 重发&quot;或&quot;末端改派&quot;。末端改派依赖承运商能力：FedEx Delivery Manager、UPS My Choice、DHL On Demand Delivery 都允许在途改装，但窗口与费用各异，且通常只能改到同一国家/地区内。跨境场景下常常&quot;退不回、改不了&quot;，只能等原单到达后新发。</li>\n<li><strong>成本由谁承担</strong>：改址引起的额外运费与时效损失，需在重排时同时产出成本归属凭证，否则会演变成对账争议。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>改址常与<strong>拆单</strong>同时发生：新地址下没有单点能满足原数量，但两个仓合起来可以，重排就输出一个拆分方案——一张承诺拆成两张子承诺，对外呈现为&quot;部分先到&quot;。拆分对买家的可接受度取决于品类：配件类可接受，成套产品（婚纱、家具）不可接受，因为缺件等于不可用。因此拆单能力必须由<strong>品类策略</strong>控制，不能全局开启。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[改址请求] --&gt; B{新地址在覆盖圈内?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[仅重算路由, 日期多不变]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{是否已出库?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[释放原仓占用, 换仓重求解]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{承运商支持在途改址?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[发起改派, 保留原承诺]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[原单到达后退回重发]&#10;    E --&gt; I{单点满足数量?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[单仓重承诺]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K{品类允许拆单?}&#10;    K --&gt;|允许| L[拆为多子承诺]&#10;    K --&gt;|不允许| M[整体延期或人工处理]\">graph TD\n    A[改址请求] --&gt; B{新地址在覆盖圈内?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[仅重算路由, 日期多不变]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{是否已出库?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[释放原仓占用, 换仓重求解]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{承运商支持在途改址?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[发起改派, 保留原承诺]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[原单到达后退回重发]\n    E --&gt; I{单点满足数量?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[单仓重承诺]\n    I --&gt;|否| K{品类允许拆单?}\n    K --&gt;|允许| L[拆为多子承诺]\n    K --&gt;|不允许| M[整体延期或人工处理]</pre><h2 id=\"例外队列与自主率的度量\">例外队列与自主率的度量</h2><p>重承诺系统如果不度量，就会退化成&quot;什么都不敢自动做，全部丢给人工&quot;。度量抓四个数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>健康区间（跨境实践参考）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动重排率</td>\n<td>无人工介入完成重排的例外占比</td>\n<td>≥ 80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺劣化率</td>\n<td>重排后日期延长的承诺 / 总重排承诺</td>\n<td>越低越好，突升即供给侧异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知准确率</td>\n<td>重排后预测日期与最终实际送达一致的占比</td>\n<td>≥ 90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次重排率</td>\n<td>同一承诺在 7 天内被重排 ≥2 次的占比</td>\n<td>≤ 5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>二次重排率</strong>是最被忽略也最有价值的指标。一张单被反复重排，说明引擎在用不稳定的解反复修补——通常是去抖没做好，或重排时读到了尚未确认的库存。它也是人工队列的主要来源，压到 5% 以下后队列规模会自然收敛。</p>\n<p>另一个要点是<strong>人工例外队列必须与自动重排共用同一求解器</strong>。若人工处置允许绕过守恒约束（如客服手动指定某仓），就会破坏那条不变量，使下一次自动重排基于错误的世界状态求解。正确做法是把人工处置表达成一次更高优先级的重排请求，而非直接写库。</p>\n<p>最后是<strong>通知与补偿的决策边界</strong>。并非每次重排都要通知买家：新日期早于或等于原承诺时静默更新版本号即可；晚于原承诺但在容忍窗口内（如 24 小时）时可只更新详情页而不主动推送；超出容忍窗口时必须主动通知并提供选项（继续等待 / 改期 / 取消），因为此时买家的期望管理成本已超过通知成本。这条边界应由业务策略显式配置，而不是写死在代码里的一个 if。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承诺必须连同<strong>支撑资源集与版本号</strong>一起持久化，否则重排只能全量重算，无法秒级响应。</li>\n<li>例外分四类：缺货（秒级）、延迟（分钟级）、改址（小时级，需确认）、冻结；供给侧与需求侧例外互为对偶。</li>\n<li>信号处理的关键是<strong>去抖三层</strong>（抖动不触发、持续偏离局部重排、硬事件直接触发），硬事件用 GS1 EPCIS 2.0 这类标准事件承载。</li>\n<li>重排必须满足<strong>守恒约束</strong>：只在受影响集合内零和再分配，绝不侵占集合外资源；排序按冻结期、价值×优先级、最小改动、成组重排四层叠加。</li>\n<li>改址是<strong>输入变更</strong>而非标签变更，链式触发覆盖判定、在途拦截与成本归属；拆单能力须由品类策略控制。</li>\n<li>度量看自动重排率、承诺劣化率、通知准确率，尤其盯住<strong>二次重排率</strong>——引擎不稳定的直接指纹。</li>\n<li>人工处置必须复用同一求解器，以高优先级重排请求进入，避免绕过守恒约束污染世界状态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承诺异常与重承诺：缺货、延迟与改址触发的重排","id":"承诺异常与重承诺-缺货-延迟与改址触发的重排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺是带失效条件的合约","id":"核心概念-承诺是带失效条件的合约"},{"level":2,"text":"例外分类与触发信号","id":"例外分类与触发信号"},{"level":2,"text":"重承诺的排序与守恒","id":"重承诺的排序与守恒"},{"level":2,"text":"改址与拆单的重承诺","id":"改址与拆单的重承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"例外队列与自主率的度量","id":"例外队列与自主率的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"承诺准确性度量：PD/PT 达成率与破损过期分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-accuracy-metrics"},"next":{"title":"承诺审计、对客一致性与合规治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-audit-compliance-governance"}}